Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/download/v2.1.278/SHASUMS256.txt.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/tarball/v2.1.278","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/zipball/v2.1.278","body":"## What's changed\n\n- Changed auto mode for Claude API and Enterprise users, and on Bedrock, Vertex, Foundry and gateways, to default to the server-side classifier, which does not charge for classifier overhead (`CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_MODE_SERVER=0` opts out on Bedrock, Vertex, Foundry and gateways); warns on billed fallback. See https://code.claude.com/docs/en/auto-mode-classifier-billing\n- Added an `Auto mode server` row to `/status` showing whether this session's auto mode classifier runs on the server\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/391877760/reactions","total_count":42,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":6,"eyes":7}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/391616593","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/391616593/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/391616593/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.277","id":391616593,"author":{"login":"ashwin-ant","id":178951676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqqV_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwin-ant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/subscriptio