-code/releases/assets/458864152","id":458864152,"node_id":"RA_kwDON91aY84bWbYY","name":"SHASUMS256.txt.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"ashwin-ant","id":178951676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqqV_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwin-ant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":833,"digest":"sha256:2bb8f82c79f71ffe0ff45a04a131232203553ed44dc4356ea11584a04c635bcc","download_count":481,"created_at":"2026-06-26T18:14:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T18:14:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/download/v2.1.195/SHASUMS256.txt.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/tarball/v2.1.195","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/zipball/v2.1.195","body":"## What's changed\n\n- Added `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_MOUSE_CLICKS` to disable mouse click/drag/hover in fullscreen mode while keeping wheel scroll\n- Fixed hook matchers with hyphenated identifiers (e.g. `code-reviewer`, `mcp__brave-search`) accidentally substring-matching — they now exact-match. Use `mcp__brave-search__.*` to match all tools from a hyphenated MCP server.\n- Fixed voice dictation on macOS capturing silence in long-running sessions after the default input device changes\n- Fixed voice dictation auto-submit never firing for languages written without spaces (Japanese, Chinese, Thai)\n- Fixed external plugins enabled only by project `.claude/settings.json` not requiring explicit install consent on every loader path\n- Fixed `/plugin` Enable/Disable not working when a plugin's `plugin.json` `name` differs from its marketplace entry name\n- Fixed background jobs disappearing from `claude agents` or losing data when written by a newer Claude Code version\n- Fixed reopening a crashed background task showing a blank screen for up to 5 seconds instead of its restart\n- Fixed background agent daemons running unreachable when the control socket fails to start, blocking restarts\n- Improved voice mode on Linux: now distinguishes \"no microphone\" from \"SoX not installed\" when SoX is present but no audio capture device exists\n- Improved `claude agents` completed list to fill available vertical space; on short terminals the header compacts so live sessions stay visible\n- Improved Remote session startup with a provisioning checklist while the container starts\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/345467919/reactions","total_count":56,"+1":19,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":9,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":10,"eyes":6}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344922230","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344922230/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344922230/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.193","id":344922230,"author":{"login":"ashwin-ant","id":178951676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqqV_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant","htm