ers/ashwin-ant","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwin-ant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":833,"digest":"sha256:c91ccae0e3c8d49e4a170b7322905af25ce0eb6f49917cfceb1ee9e590a81f21","download_count":169,"created_at":"2026-06-24T18:51:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:51:46Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/download/v2.1.191/SHASUMS256.txt.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/tarball/v2.1.191","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/zipball/v2.1.191","body":"## What's changed\n\n- Added `/rewind` support for resuming a conversation from before `/clear` was run\n- Fixed scroll position jumping to the bottom while reading earlier output during a streaming response\n- Fixed background agents resurrecting after being stopped — stopping an agent from the tasks panel is now permanent\n- Fixed `/voice` showing a generic \"not available\" message when disabled by an organization's policy — it now explains the restriction\n- Fixed `/login` URL opening truncated in Windows Terminal when it wraps across lines\n- Fixed Cmd+click on links in fullscreen mode for Ghostty over ssh/tmux\n- Fixed `claude agents` sending builtin slash commands like `/usage` to background sessions as prompt text instead of showing a hint\n- Fixed `claude agents` job rows showing full filesystem paths for pasted images instead of the `[Image #N]` placeholder\n- Fixed hooks with comma-separated matchers (e.g. `\"Bash,PowerShell\"`) silently never firing\n- Fixed `/permissions` Recently-denied tab: approving a denial now persists on close instead of being silently discarded\n- Fixed the agent panel jumping by one row when scrolling the roster past the overflow cap\n- Fixed the welcome splash art overflowing the default 80×24 macOS Terminal window\n- Fixed managed settings: `forceRemoteSettingsRefresh` now takes effect when set via MDM or file policy, and the fetch sends `Cache-Control: no-cache` to prevent proxies from serving stale responses\n- Improved sandbox network permission dialog: hosts you allow with \"Yes\" are now remembered for the rest of the session instead of re-prompting on every connection\n- Improved MCP server reliability: capability discovery (`tools/list`, `prompts/list`, `resources/list`) now retries transient network errors with short backoff\n- Improved MCP OAuth: discovery and token requests now retry once after transient network errors, and headless environments skip the browser popup and go straight to the paste-the-URL prompt\n- Improved MCP error messages: HTTP 404 errors now show the URL and point to your MCP config\n- Improved vim mode prompt-history search (NORMAL `/`) to hint how to reach slash commands\n- Reduced CPU usage during streaming responses by ~37% by coalescing text updates to 100ms\n- Reduced long-session memory growth from terminal output cache\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344307226/reactions","total_count":24,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":3,"eyes":2}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344172504","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344172504/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/344172504/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.190","id":344172504,"author":{"login":"ashwin-ant","id":178951676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqqV_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwin-ant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDON91aY84Ug6fY","tag_name":"v2.1.190","target_commitish":"main","name":"v2.1.190","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-06-24T15:53:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T15:53:56Z","published_at":"2026-06-24T15:53:56Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/releases/assets/456716923","id":456716923,"node_id":"RA_kwDON91aY84bOPJ7","name":"claude-darwin-arm64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"ashwin-ant","id":178951676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqqV_A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178951676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant","html_url":"https://github.com/ashwin-ant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashwin-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us